📷 Sample Inputs & Outputs

This project includes several example images demonstrating how the Roadmap Creator processes different types of inputs.

sampleinput1.png – Shows a typical user input containing phases, tasks, and structure for generating a roadmap.

sampleout1-2.png – Displays the structured roadmap output for the above input, formatted into phases and subtasks.

sampleout3.png – Another example output showing multiple phases and generated steps.

sampleout2.png – Important case: Demonstrates the system’s safety behavior.

If a user provides content related to hacking, illegal activities, or harmful intent, the agent automatically stops, refusing to generate a roadmap and returning a safety message.

This ensures the tool cannot be misused for unethical or dangerous purposes.

These examples highlight both the roadmap generator’s functionality and its built-in security safeguards.
